<title>BRAZIL: Japan's Hashimoto leaves Brazil for Peru.</title>
<headline>Japan's Hashimoto leaves Brazil for Peru.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto left Brasilia on Monday for Lima, the penultimate stop on a 10-day Latin American tour, a Brazilian Foreign Ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Hashimoto, who has already visited Mexico and Chile, spent three days in Brazil. After Peru, he was due to go to Costa Rica.</p>
</text>
